The [[Acorn Collar]] is an [[accessory]] available in the shop for [[Ranger]]s. Similarly to the [[Ranger Bag]], it gives adjacent items crit chance proportional to the player's {{icon/luck}}. 

There are three [[Acorn Collar]] variants that can be crafted. They all at least somewhat care about the player's {{icon/luck}}.

The [[Red Orchid Collar]] can be crafted catalytically by using a [[Blood Amulet]]. It gives lifesteal to the adjacent items proportional to the player's {{icon/luck}}, and still gives critical chance, but proportional to {{icon/vampirism}} instead. 

The [[Blue Sage Collar]] can be crafted catalytically by using a [[Mana Orb]]. It gives {{icon/mana}} whenever adjacent [[weapon]]s hit, more often the higher the player's {{icon/luck}}.

The [[White Lily Collar]] can be crafted catalytically by using a [[Holy Armor]]. When adjacent items activate it gives the player {{icon/luck}} and {{icon/regeneration}}. It also gives those items crit chance proportional to both the {{icon/luck}} and {{icon/regeneration}} of the player. 

The [[Acorn Collar]] can also be used to craft the [[Critwood Staff]] when combined with the [[Magic Staff]], which uses {{icon/mana}} to deal more damage and make all hits crit for a time.

The [[Acorn Ace]] skill makes collar items have a much larger {{icon/star}} area and also makes items in that area use less stamina. It also makes the [[Critwood Staff]] use much less stamina.
